NO CONNECTOME IS DISTRIBUTED HERE. The datasets below are obtained by the
tools in tools/ from their own sources, under their own terms. Anybody
redistributing a derived export is responsible for checking the licence of the
dataset it came from -- they are not all the same, and one of them is only
reachable with a personal access token.

Datasets this project reads:

- FlyWire / FAFB, adult female Drosophila. Used via Open Fly.
- Fish1, larval zebrafish (7dpf). Lichtman and Engert laboratories, Harvard
  University, with the Connectomics team at Google. Accessed through CAVE.
- MICrONS cubic millimetre, mouse visual cortex. IARPA MICrONS programme.
- C. elegans connectome, Cook et al. (2019).
- Drosophila larva connectome, Winding et al. (2023).
- Ciona intestinalis larva connectome, Ryan et al. (2016).

Code this project reuses:

- The leaky integrate-and-fire core follows model.py from
